  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The Kjeldahl method of Nitrogen estimation fails for which of the following reaction products?</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7d1ba3a8-27d5-4cf6-86e9-3e99f36f2c4f-image.png\" style=\"width: 523px; height: 255px;\" /></p>",
